CONCERNING

PROTECTION FOR WOMEN AND CHILDREN

BY THE GRACE OF ALMIGHTY GOD

REGENT OF DONGGALA,
a. that women and children are creations of Almighty God who constitute important elements of Indonesian society and nation;
b. that Indonesian women have an important role in community activities, development and family life and have the obligation to care for, protect and raise Indonesian children to grow and develop as the nation's next generation;c. that Indonesian children are Indonesian human resources who will become actors in all fields of social and state life;
d. that in social life women and children in Donggala Regency often experience violence or unpleasant treatment so that it is considered important to protect them;
e. based on the considerations as referred to in letter a, letter b, letter c, and letter d, a Regional Regulation is established
